          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "These books are quite incredible and hold a lot of very important weight to both the Old Testament and the New Testament. There are promises made in these books that are kept through Christ, and there are some really great opening points for other parts of the Bible (like Psalms, and many of the prophets, including the minor ones, as well as the books from Solomon).",
