          "verse": 3,
          "startVerse": 3,
          "endVerse": 3,
          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "These sons of Eli will be mentioned more later, but we will just say that they were not the right ones to be leading the people for the worship of the Lord. Sadly, that’s a pattern that still holds true today. There are far fewer who are capable of leading God’s people with a proper standing than there are who think they are capable and (as it turns out) are awful leaders. This should not scare us out of church, or leave us in constant judgement and closed off to the church as a whole (because a few bad eggs do not rot the whole cartoon), but rather we should be cautious about who we talk to, who we trust, and who we allow to influence us, furthermore being cautious of our own souls.",
